{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa01898a2146aab8856566a71ff6fa3b2459143bde0079b352a97419ebd844e4",
      "text": "希望的VICTORY",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b41f108edf7469451896b141d3a408bc500d14a19d4cf55b05d531fb7b2e9706",
      "text": "为了在男极“速度部门”中战斗，\nW出战了偶像大运动会。一路领先\n领跑的两人，却因一个小失误\n引发了争执。进而享介还察觉到了\n他们犯下的更严重的失误……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000016:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000016:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa01898a2146aab8856566a71ff6fa3b2459143bde0079b352a97419ebd844e4",
      "text": "希望的VICTORY",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611d65eabf4a7e83ea4e559cf66e7abd19250c0c4f8814a6867211be98510331",
      "text": "偶像大运动会当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4872da6ef2ec1b258c3e950c4a56ff19c61627784b1211a2e6aaef8be7d86cf4",
      "text": "“宣誓！我们作为偶像，无论发生什么，\n都一定会迅速抵达舞台！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ebd28e21108e8137297b532fa8088b37f74ce182d87c7e650b2527d90603994",
      "text": "“我们发誓，所有参赛者都将以第一名为目标，\n堂堂正正地展开竞赛！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:315b4a1a12037300294954d86f146dd101ec38b08b06e0a9892f25847766af7d",
      "text": "非常感谢！\n那么《偶像大运动会》现在正式开幕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000071:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:072245937730980a3afa64e9d9a6bffdf4b61b17c15cb55d9b074352985e1d67",
      "text": "开幕式后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d00d9317af9d7acb2aa37d290aebe51c320704df182d0e77f3f1d9a9fff44ed",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n我们的选手宣誓感觉挺不错的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25aa539310baf9e230104d9254bc9871c1e553317ae48fb03ac92ed51f4c2f6",
      "text": "堂堂正正的，非常帅气哦！赶来应援的\n神速一魂两个人也是这么说的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccd4d3a18480abb1a58ce950a746a48da3de8cef320f04a91d6f47b03e4a08bf",
      "text": "嘿嘿，再多夸夸我也行哦♪\n不过在正赛里，我们会展现出更棒的一面的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83e3866aebbb2b2e5fdcd0d004fad45f4ef52ac8fda331573376c766807df39c",
      "text": "共同参赛的人里，好像有很多对运动能力很有自信的\n肌肉猛男硬汉偶像……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30fa5be1769f460da90db8c63a5e922c5a9af126746cafd2576facea0b7d18d0",
      "text": "但能赢过曾是足球选手的我们这种事，\n可没有哪个偶像做得到！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6893f30b7ef4f4461e94b7fbe026c2e97c7fb19f85c2d8e68974d8424dab47",
      "text": "让他们见识一下，\n曾在球场上纵横驰骋的我们的力量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_a:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:42cd5658beae1c5f7ef55d9a8e973439e603f1e84851ea7d261d705f722909fa",
      "text": "没错！所以说，●●●●●●●●●●监督。\n优胜就交给W吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a4d4375f6ae961c0b3b7487bd5f514230d5fa3ce72e17f2c08702099349e3d9",
      "text": "喔，差不多该集合了吧？\n走吧，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f3e4e556891f23b1a8bc6d75fb1f2253516c68fa0cb13ff9bf215af238efcf9",
      "text": "啊，你先过去吧。\n我还有话想跟●●●●●●●●●●监督说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26e083116e910310c05a9d23cf3fc119b7a06315b09eab09106e6ad38bcca9a2",
      "text": "知道了。那我先过去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa93fed7e9036183f6d3b58818369085403d645d1545ba7a08283df2a297f392",
      "text": "那个。是关于悠介脚上的伤……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01bfef626dd47a74f275452ec80813e7addd9e9b9985595310bb866a8aa7daa0",
      "text": "有什么担心的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:770e33d9065a887f42ee6bd455318f6dd3d4808428a67d9a30d0e28db8aa3650",
      "text": "没，他本人是说没问题啦。\n还说我总是瞎操心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c2e2ba3bd37ce6e92f3e98d39dc7ae00c86bb59ed06f815def58c3c6574816f",
      "text": "虽说直到今天进行了各种特训，确实也\n什么事都没发生。但悠介那家伙的性格你也知道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:32622e80aeabc8680fd58fe1af18cff03642248b1210a1ed3ed96d7ce7372f39",
      "text": "我担心他在正赛里会不会勉强自己……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a9d76d01154bcc6646e03c5ade3578e75d96f4bf2d357e81fca64ac50e6cada",
      "text": "要是真变成那样，我也会去阻止他的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c445f6f0e5ab194e07fa210c95c5635e6fe60e9bf2ab5f10231d81961b0bef8",
      "text": "这样啊……谢啦，监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2658c051467a59333d54a876f92b2211d0db105763ad6ba4b7c76c08d5bba7d2",
      "text": "是悠介自己说“想参加”的。\n我想尊重那家伙的意愿。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2678b52d866788a0a465978caee9a21dab63939decb7b01e7826cb900c9958d",
      "text": "明明都决定好了。明明都已经到当天了。\n我真是不中用啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c03ba492b7bac5abac2714c86e01098386d7c88ad979d054d90f947b1a8bbae",
      "text": "偶像大运动会 开幕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a646f650539f9292adb4dc4f86702e718d11c73e64fd1dcf7226420282f4d4e0",
      "text": "偶像大运动会终于开始了！\n第一项比赛是两人三足！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc92489c9de04a6599ce5404d446730046825e4e4b4286124a04d9ad79b8fddc",
      "text": "一路领先领跑的是这两位！\n来自315 Production的……W！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d1d28334304e8efcbefc0a423fa71cfb9f8583b95e800b08d11fcfc33895c21",
      "text": "一、二、一、二……等等，喂，悠介！\n别自顾自加快节奏啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09860e888e518c09626dafc2793ad233e4227234af4c23eaf5151f1d26397c69",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉！\n我想着就算是享介，不用我说也能跟上的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a35904930641ee8b8513ecf9faebe03fedb9832c428f4aeaac8ba82ff3491106",
      "text": "就这样拉开压倒性的差距，\n一口气甩开所有人跑完2圈吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9e1490073abca7850e07536ee12cdd9af7e3b9bc77409bdcc57c5131b1418ea",
      "text": "一旦决定的事就听不进劝……我知道了啦。\n但你要考虑体力分配。现在的速度已经是极限了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c8481c4a02a9b7d8abcd92af0bb875334548c76922530b0c0cfc2850bdfd1a3",
      "text": "收到！我说，享介。\n就这样一口气拿下优胜，去终点的舞台上唱歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd25bf274f66d0664ed3078a12d0206cd1f7a819d36824da67d5ed8fd10fcbd",
      "text": "嗯。为了更接近男极KING，\n一定要拿到第1名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea460e64a1f29f32b4159bb164a1c53bbd0ac8b965e802574c25f2b19213c24e",
      "text": "W实在太快了！谁也追不上！但是\n其他偶像也依然还有机会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0687bb7fcdda8d7bc954f72e802c27251e0e7f791da9e50aed29e9f48f32d4",
      "text": "在跑完场馆内的跑道后，\n场外还有许许多多的比赛项目在等待着选手们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:635255e80305e51ada6055af0cba9f75f37da5f42a316294375e6ba90dd98ae1",
      "text": "能站上舞台的只有第1名的偶像！\n究竟是谁能摘得胜利的荣耀呢！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c280ba1476b1ad449f885e2b6f78ed4f03c75e3eea7f6c9fe4dccedbd081a4e",
      "text": "下一个项目是……平衡木吗。这种程度小菜一碟啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f189ac667c3497adde104ea686d233b32ddb2eb91f95eee8fc2bf5aee5c3b787",
      "text": "别大意啊，悠介！\n好好看着前面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fc14b32bdd1697aa216a35486a4523412a3da97758abfc68e6ea2d0dfe2ef028",
      "text": "我的平衡感有多好你又不是不知道。\n看招……你看，这不是完全没问题嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:220cc6e6d4a2c52a30f0791c803783f5a91cb82268c6c877a57fb30781b9300e",
      "text": "好啦好啦。那接下来轮到我了。\n嘿……好，顺利通过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00a6e12772a79fb4b8d86ca69311eb06ef1fdc3bfae16c398d8f9a136372266c",
      "text": "这次的比赛是……两个人互相传球带球\n前进就行了吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58108801dd2e8cc0c443520b2e5f2c9ea2c76a839e9fe875bd14b8cb77a1a086",
      "text": "凭我们的话轻轻松松就能通关啦。\n上吧，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000124:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d5e5916b0799fa09fd3916645ca52e1e0c011705afbefb3a2c07cb9c26ede6e",
      "text": "好传，悠介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9655ee47f049ab641b4e393db8e9aa7a56db8b5a096e8b48118bdb415b21cf99",
      "text": "（……嗯。脚的状况看起来没问题。\n就这样配合悠介的节奏的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000160:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18fc4d2aab9dbfe2933ec082a00c5e34bd899ba5a80aeb63c81fe605a5621ca6",
      "text": "看啊，享介！跟第2名已经拉开这么大差距了。\n我们绝对是一马当先啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_d:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce1b829a5e8273abc83b6a1c8ca47cd2ea54008a7356bac23a0cd3e001f02cb8",
      "text": "果然我们是最强的！\n保持这个势头，继续冲吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60f3a9f8d48307e6fe8e76de1fefcbaca9333cfd8d4fe91392da672164cacf6c",
      "text": "W到达折返点了。在这里，\n将要挑战“搭档默契问答”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ece90cedb36ca5dd8b1099722c25cde27a72d12f04dd6ee6637c6a11caccf29",
      "text": "这个对我们来说也很简单吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16ae8032b9a7a3bd3218ed681a019f629aa5152e6d874182f776b281121d4aab",
      "text": "没毛病。轻轻松松全问答对给他们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:401d30c3e7d63d78b2784f5430626ab37f6fac3df9218e27ffcf62d65daea99a",
      "text": "……回答正确！不愧是W，不愧是双胞胎，\n再次给出了完全一致的答案！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a58d954fb8d9ea4ff684877f751ebfa8c76b13cabef3d8ac4c9f49a4cb88248f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那是当然♪\n下一题也会完美答出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25a0168ffbb103f59713f8dbafb1f485fb23599a2c34b6573916775554e2630e",
      "text": "那么……第4题！\n苍井享介讨厌的食物是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19ed6e55192c571414ee3d7b7261132cf6a9f39b4488c76b9180f13947e1f2da",
      "text": "好——！青椒！……啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f00e23c1eeb71c97e135566da9a99b3504ddc92aa01f1e95d601e8696f105e0",
      "text": "……悠介，那是你自己讨厌的吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:201881cc0223fafa094707306958b04d943a57dca0b51116433a9aa84add279b",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，搞错了！\n刚才那次不算……不行，是吧……可恶——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09768302aafb2f3d31bd487815fa938158596a2523f9ee12f85fef2c8a35d6a2",
      "text": "（搞什么啊，明明应该全对的……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1ebcc23f8b40ca67ecc9bfa90a902d2eb94ea5f242691b3ed0b78035bfa3c7c",
      "text": "那么，第6题！苍井悠介害怕的东西是！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000137:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7cc073b242dcf1a75f6ca649f47fd946f39663cc99e23a67f558831d2587788d",
      "text": "是幽灵哦。悠介胆子真的很小。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f67bc3506d92b333340dec4d45638304459996cbf74beeccefc208125280e1d",
      "text": "前阵子电视上播恐怖片预告的时候，\n他还被吓了一大跳呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9c4e9fa41233daba1515e6c9b9a37ed487c9f7d174ad24fd780f5c94198db4",
      "text": "享介明明到现在还超害怕看牙医好不好！\n每次去的时候都吓得不行～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000169:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b4f7f671383743d323d0095f001126ddadd69119bc89639c35c43c1358c3ab6",
      "text": "什……这没必要说出来吧。\n现在问的是悠介害怕的东西啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000173:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34d73c1cdcedf77b4bb6263d90376727fa6adcc8ae7b248389adcb0449e4d71",
      "text": "先多嘴的人明明是享介你吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_e:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bb777f41ea8d3e5818e1d5399997d7157bd46d8b4ec154f1dfbafe803215d57",
      "text": "那个……咳咳！那么，请听下一题！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cd4f0caa2530e2213e719ce52ee9065db5ab1fec23a93b726299fd0b4991c2f",
      "text": "唉，别说全答对了，简直是一塌糊涂。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11fa2181575571f601d501cd57bb3bd2d67d1fa81a5276a93545f5e7e43dbc75",
      "text": "是我不好啦。但是关于我的问题，\n享介不也答错好几个嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f35f7359669119f0db6dad8d2d2ba8a0de62d18c57757e7725a4af128bc33d2",
      "text": "那个是……没办法的吧。\n因为悠介你自己乱了阵脚，我也被带偏了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aef9c125e93e3e5898f659e49ac8d8fc4d37b61c8b91942c9f8c6483acf4866",
      "text": "…………怪我咯。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:721544a3e77bec0f9f58af4119419ca45708300be7f97bd7ade37710989239aa",
      "text": "……算了。我先走了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6899fc0bc8c94f19c9155cabde18ca5790eb23c70aadefb9c191754ac922e793",
      "text": "啊，喂，悠介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4963d3c453b554bf899ef3c3c62b32ea797d8857fc184b8b3c88624f66f40b2c",
      "text": "（那家伙……明明规则是两个人一起冲线啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b01b2bcc3a1b8325320f4d7d67bf7798e52f7701e0baa53b8567ee0ce7fcc9",
      "text": "喂——，享介先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dacade7739de6df723e566d2ffef4a0ee34dca6dd6b2b9747832d35bcac1807",
      "text": "朱雀，还有玄武？\n你们大老远跑来这里帮我们加油吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_f:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b78d07ec6f0b43a20a54cba0d4d2d08d24dccec0396109ff4a172b51a6ef620",
      "text": "嗯，从会场那边赶过来的。\n比起隔着屏幕，我们更想直接到现场为你们打气。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2b654a7999adcc7de2de544c7b3565e1f80154f39bc9e81086732a1e54c708d",
      "text": "话说回来，悠介大哥怎么了？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c096cd0d8545cbe56389ec9acd83053e97584a8a3b5861436e73fdabfb4db09",
      "text": "啊——……我们现在稍微分开行动了一下。\n没事，马上就会汇合的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7140991e18f4a1db0c40cc686501affe50e08a2f83656af324059940311b153",
      "text": "那就好！不过话说回来，\n你们两个人一开始真是太猛了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0e09527225a0748aa299b2a0fd7ac8b9add706485bdf552623350d6a26b8796",
      "text": "把其他人甩得远远的，\n第一个跑完了3圈啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ad14ace2efcc74ec8a8ddfc34cbb177af10679ea9881b1f07168452184ec24a",
      "text": "诶……？3圈？不是2圈吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5db0d656ec9800a351a4ee38f0dfde2b218800b02fcc9875ff24b3dcddec8b1e",
      "text": "不，应该确实是3圈才对。\n等等，享介大哥，难道你们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4008c8a4aecdba52c500352407b1605037f6a90dc798afb1e2938eea9b9081e",
      "text": "我们……只跑了2圈。但是，\n发给我们的资料上确实写的是2圈啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2298e79b06448f6c9701bcce96ae0ec1cf9a0a4c250c3cd1998ee90b7a4aaf7b",
      "text": "真、真的假的！？\n你们两个跑得太快了，根本没人注意到啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9714fb273d0ee332824081d80e026ddb923eb348e6f9aaff62e7a8e42212bc1c",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，\n没有说什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f613e0ee921526d76509dcf1ad52e44f933c1cbbd784a18d1bad19733bdaeda6",
      "text": "没说。可能只有我们这边\n拿到了写错规则的资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e936ecfa25aceff147086c5d965a1eb91658129a0132c20c6dadadb4b8a87cb4",
      "text": "这可大事不妙了！……玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46dbb5e38690c2038cffa6187c129efd1e984f576ea3658892c8dc85d4f089d0",
      "text": "嗯。总之得先去把这件事\n告诉番长！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f0d8fb93371b81e614654250841abce171a48e7900c4241a50f776e9f646e77",
      "text": "谢谢你们两个。拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000191:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cc64a5b099d94c84cade66f105ae93311468a70a63bbdade2da6a3c8358a253",
      "text": "（……怎么办……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000195:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7eb4c10c446254b4a36cef38895e78b1e9367dc63255f1cae27b82ac6fed3237",
      "text": "（悠介有注意到这件事吗？\n如果我是悠介的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000199:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c229609228a570f35b5f92b9cdcbca0d42a950c563eaa635a8e32daaa1c9757",
      "text": "（是无视这个失误直接冲向终点？\n还是放弃第1名，折返回会场……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000209:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b277797dec70caa0f8214ef74738fbbb51a32e9d98ec555b5ea0f5b3639d77b5",
      "text": "不能去想“要是悠介会怎样”。\n我不能总是把事情推到悠介身上。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_g:cmd-000214:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d1c4562395f22e11cf3567554a41df17b5d3db2667736dc90d91d65ce58a81c",
      "text": "必须由我自己……堂堂正正地决定前进的方向！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bbbba3a7a5aabadaabb9f862b75fd9bf82b27de3eedeec118a51e62858da195",
      "text": "偶像大运动会·会场",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fde4519ad740e84c4159914456f3e707d5d6a03c38afc11f4581d6c0f7c1d3",
      "text": "哈啊、哈啊…………！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:574a1ea28513171d2b5e019b72d9b05a0844c9bf3d251fd7c33baac90b1ab1de",
      "text": "……总算来了。太慢了，享介！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75f5fc7cecc3b06aa7a864fb4318b96a5ee0383f541bb77926f7cf9c7acf3c17",
      "text": "是你跑得太快了啦！\n……那么，开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd97fcad55dfe84cb572e118ef25b0124d127dee11aff1574101a2dfd3af50b5",
      "text": "……不好意思！W少跑了1圈！\n我们现在重新补跑——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6702cd81f04377c6016f4e725d7fae7e3194e5296fb1a88e2220644aa433d197",
      "text": "喂。你是猜到了我的想法，才回这里的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5950dfd9523450430fb0bd1a10f8421056d54ce76a35474ae8c56bfdaa0cb57e",
      "text": "不是。是因为我自己想回来才回来的。\n不过……看到悠介你在，我安心多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2a4706aa96eeebf44b4004e4d19786b2b1fde0241ff8d2ed1ddc6e39ad2b170",
      "text": "说什么呢。\n真是个让人放心不下的弟弟啊～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ab228d5774fc38d3dda97a93e49528fbc94db7e291fdaebc7ea739b07079fe3",
      "text": "……唉。明明耍帅宣誓过了，\n这下肯定拿倒数第一了。太逊了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1a1834e6d3265ec9a0caa92a6158919295ce8c41ecc89a51b54e0132d30bc269",
      "text": "315 Pro的大家，可不会觉得我们逊哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05252d9634ca437bdedc6189a90081ccf04c817f2c4925e1091bc9fe507c4d9e",
      "text": "神速一魂他们俩，\n听说我要折返的时候感动得不行呢。……不过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000149:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7da7396690e1a9534d7cf7db544b222cb79542d77b20c8bcf95230101cc0c76f",
      "text": "……输掉果然还是很不甘心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000161:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0219c7ef87db5e4b3c55cc2eac1a713de47a38a16ff6d0b057fe9c74fa497682",
      "text": "算是吧。既然要比就不想输。\n赢下比赛的感觉很棒，也很痛快。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_h:cmd-000166:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dae66c4ef01a4a85c1d92f8b53b5fc2ead94a438aadbcc7bc52599b8b61af057",
      "text": "……但是啊。我喜欢的东西还有很多呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01e25367905095958275bb989c5ae537a6c11d64bddb8e39db02915ba0e99146",
      "text": "喜欢的东西？……除了赢比赛之外？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71a0ab62c3240987900a43146b2c9a6ab2b05d22e027e6f82bba6122d71f6c8f",
      "text": "嗯。比如你，还有●●●●●●●●●●监督。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5637f8140767876a79680427a2a6d893cb5b88e6fd76942a196c34b94811995",
      "text": "闪闪发光的，只要和这家伙在一起就能一直奔跑下去的\n存在……大概对我来说，就像希望一样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0103af7f23210d89d99ddd2c4a413503e4a2b62dbefff6582f6d4b2bbe1cf0dc",
      "text": "只要有希望在，无论我身在何处，\n都能回想起在球场上奔跑时那种小鹿乱撞的心情。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ad18c7f1fcb1ac9d42b5da97d46b70357d5c3f13bcc93c1095b488e41d5494c",
      "text": "悠介……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ab110006b8b0ba4ac10cd4dfeb1738251e461054e39bc5a31e1312055ec637c",
      "text": "无论是足球，还是偶像。\n只要两个人一起跑下去，就一定能到达终点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ae7e763b6e0e94febb21494a79061e0935838a02774a547fee73651f5bc12d",
      "text": "哪怕绕了再多的远路。\n最强的双胞胎最终拿下的，一定会是VICTORY！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d62498d70021455609c08aa2fb4bec9cd06b6ab0c17f34ef25718fbb3e3fdc",
      "text": "……嗯，说得对！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa2fc3bb39e809d567d69256925033acd003675703d6cee032022fae41fa12ff",
      "text": "嘿嘿。好，别垂头丧气的了，跑起来吧！\n要上咯——……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_i:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43036fea3e8d00d40dd53693519b5971e2195b13c12e00feb5ba218437464aa7",
      "text": "一、二、一、二……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000014:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0edfc213b2c45a845881a59b62f0d67bcfd80065792d9df654ba0c95eb6ba4a2",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:018237656b1e9321a879caff58b8088e45cb2e3b6ccf4794e4d9a02484c530d6",
      "text": "非常抱歉！\n由于我们的疏忽，给各位添麻烦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b771a205af8c2aa36ec5b64a157097f7608276b9d0e7dbeba69028fa9702772",
      "text": "啊，请抬起头来！\n我们一开始也没注意到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45297373fbaad876172ed6f43ff9ec233bfb7282c0eecdaf14ef08c944a6da2",
      "text": "嗯——……那作为补偿的话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2062a85e6b086c1664f3a8d8b48a1a207d6257fb50ad30ce3ea71183ce45f2",
      "text": "虽然不是第1名，但也让我们唱一首歌吧！\n我们的体力还充裕得很呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ae346920c0ddd8832d7735fadc9ff374491300156ccb193e060d2a705b90d46e",
      "text": "好提议！让他们在舞台上见识一下，\n前足球选手的耐力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dec27f2bb82584fd9b80a540413c8c6ed975d058e363cdc7b46dd3098ca7e156",
      "text": "当然可以！\n我这就去安排，拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000083:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ccdf72e12a7fb5112c5a150bf5f275606717bddcc45339d03a20373fa3a13a3",
      "text": "男极竞技场·户外舞台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a27b60f7ce463f8a040e7b2ab59e92e5535c5d090cda243b3318d124c9f297e2",
      "text": "呀吼——！我们是来自315 Production的W！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36970d6a0bdeef3ced91b6af6d93783e2661378c276fc163a9dd70f5b408a011",
      "text": "我们拿到了特别奖，获得了唱歌的机会哦。\n大家一起嗨到最后吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8e04214e8f9a364092f60d86f9db81d4f73431112c52ce0c0dfcd3abb8b8a02",
      "text": "那么悠介，老样子来咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7ce61731b25629b245d18bcbebc5ea635238bddb3f3e44032414591f1b3c496",
      "text": "哦！把最强双胞胎的演出，传递给大家吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000145:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当天夜晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faab128146383227545a45b1cbcbcb0b5c042dbccb9cf302eca2bf43694072bc",
      "text": "啊，喂？\n突然打电话给你不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7947c105a7789df9e1365b4e28d2696efa9009c639b97fad16143286f926e3e",
      "text": "趁悠介在洗澡的空当，\n我想跟●●●●●●●●●●监督聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac61658d8c66f160fd5dac826f2e857e518cab5ac897d1c89d8f535779628cef",
      "text": "再次向你说声，今天辛苦了！虽然发生了\n很多预料之外的事，不过真的很开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b978e1d1d9aba5d3d712b4e5fa46470f4640383850b136504122e58fd3dde6d6",
      "text": "结果虽然不是第1名，而是特别奖。但这是我自己\n做出了问心无愧的抉择拿到的，我并不后悔。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d71012a1d1f4a25255781725aa3b6e681a6314ed69eda40a37789d8a1e2dfee4",
      "text": "不过，悠介那种不假思索的行动真让人伤脑筋啊～。\n要是我没折回去的话，他打算怎么办啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000163:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9e8f2688cfcfe1da7ed14b0dd6d370003d72cd051348bbc24e2813349a832eab",
      "text": "或许他早就知道\n享介先生一定会回来的",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d78a76ae86eaa74676059eaf8f2fabc893066a6abe3b86d7eb5c04cf0c9e9f51",
      "text": "……也许吧。\n看着重新跑起来时的悠介，我再一次体会到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06bf2504bb98aec1603dbc1b86c494d2e4cb890959b7536507f012d8ced6bf44",
      "text": "那家伙的言语和表情，真的很耀眼呢。\n有时候，甚至会让我觉得有些遥远……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000172:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e971bfaadcf01ae62b1995b4dae6b5fd8066c71b7cf55adf86c68be7351e1d41",
      "text": "……啊！\n悠介好像洗完澡出来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000174:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea3a8ca6500e67da3969abdd12f316597b6fa052b3469cfa163eefa1d8700116",
      "text": "他在叫我了，我先挂了哦。\n谢谢你听我说话。回头见，监督！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000186:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000198:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f89f0a7205fb1e2556b09cf4e39a8476e1133394063e7cec00e26d8fdd878dcb",
      "text": "这么晚打扰真不好意思，●●●●●●●●●●监督！\n已经睡了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000200:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80c01703604e031e2e226fd43ef3e5128e17f71ae08e9f883529c1462eea3f8d",
      "text": "还醒着呢",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000201:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae563d401510c89e64ef36e736fa333ed63c370ef668eb12d0e60ea4630db61",
      "text": "怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000205:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47f5eb19346856dfd426ca6cecd0544ff5ec77d54163e278ef6578c020294151",
      "text": "啊，还醒着啊？太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000207:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4e7dbe7ee0aa40af9726bd73535d3cce05b8a34265b30ed34958b189adbe4f9",
      "text": "……哎呀，糟糕。声音太大的话\n会把享介吵醒的，我得注意点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000209:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7481716034eb7a30c633fc22a967d94ca31d2dc6bd7dce0d045c1e6f13ef4a7e",
      "text": "稍微有点睡不着。\n能让我聊聊关于今天运动会的事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000211:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9651974dd46b4b0b61191e0de4bfcb9428141bf41b768751e920af2780cd7e7",
      "text": "当然可以",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000214:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:597a54023548ff81458888dec8c60055976caca9e3d6628030d7afd62318a97a",
      "text": "谢谢。\n今天能和享介一起奔跑，我真的很开心哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000216:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59cb947db7bb3dd733423ca30a0e61516c3ffb7c33f1af759492dbf132027f20",
      "text": "平时我总是让那家伙\n操各种各样的心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000218:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f53d49c53ac084583746f26dd4a617da41ade861f635e921481ca5d35bb76fa",
      "text": "要是能稍微以哥哥的身份，\n展现出帅气的一面就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000220:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:184e8bd6c4229b0f2c8b628994e480cae1d8b8715144e17e0eafa9aef58c2e4c",
      "text": "哈啊……咦，好像突然犯困了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000222:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f6a1938a077813c17816eabfa15588f1f5dce27355d641a4b920275940f7005",
      "text": "跑了一整天，又唱了歌……\n能量大概用光了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_j:cmd-000224:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87679e02972a4d0f858ad378ecf73da1aabe71a19bc7a5f1555b55c4e66103b5",
      "text": "嗯……监督，谢谢你听我说话。\n今晚我们都好好休息吧。晚安……",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
